using `scheduledDate` with `urgency=ON_SCHEDULED_DATE`, matching the OpenMRS order contract.\r\n7. Keeps duplicate active/upcoming medication search results visible with an \"Already prescribed\" cue, while disabling duplicate actions to avoid backend overlap errors.\r\n8. Updates tests for the Vitest setup and adds coverage for bucketing, future-start payloads, duplicate blocking, same-day date snapping, and revision behavior.\r\n\r\n## Screenshots\r\n\r\n### Upcoming Aspirin 162.5mg order scheduled for 28th May\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1446\" height=\"1045\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-05-22 at 01 46 55\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/84ddbbef-a44b-4bfa-9300-772fd3c450de\" />\r\n\r\n### Search result duplicate guard\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1446\" height=\"1045\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-05-22 at 01 47 20\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c0321cf5-ad84-46d4-ab4b-b219e6826828\" />\r\n\r\n## Related Issue\r\nhttps://openmrs.atlassian.net/browse/O3-5374\r\nhttps://openmrs.atlassian.net/browse/O3-5375\r\nhttps://openmrs.atlassian.net/browse/O3-5376\r\n\r\n## Other","freshness":[{"repo":"github.com/openmrs/openmrs-esm-patient-chart","lastSyncedAt":"2026-10-31T16:11:21.842Z","stale":false}],"nextOffset":null,"truncated":[]}"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"295d7873-48a4-41d4-8ce9-403f7865bb6e","uuid":"fac96829-d94e-4ff4-b1a7-b506ec26d13f","timestamp":"2026-10-31T16:16:56.489Z","tool_use_result":[{"type":"text","text":"{"repo":"github.com/openmrs/openmrs-esm-patient-chart","number":2973,"kind":"pr","title":"(feat) O3-5374: Add support for future medication start dates","state":"merged","author":"Sadashii","createdAt":"2026-01-27T17:52:16.000Z","mergedAt":"2026-05-25T20:18:13.000Z","closedAt":"2026-05-25T20:18:13.000Z","url":"https://github.com/openmrs/openmrs-esm-patient-chart/pull/2973","mergeCommit":"b8d3fe2ea7a8546c4f4800029bdaec4f6423a8c8","syncedAt":"2026-10-31T16:11:21.842Z","tickets":[{"key":"O3-4433","source":"ticket-pattern"},{"key"